n": "Except here\u2019s the thing\u2026 it\u2019s not just one task.\n\nIt\u2019s the bathrooms, the floors, the kitchen, the dusting, the baseboards, the fingerprints, the random little nooks that somehow get dirty again the second you clean them.\n\nAnd when you add it all up, that\u2019s HOURS of my week.\n\nHours that, at 2 months postpartum, I\u2019d much rather spend nursing my daughter, soaking up a contact nap, getting on the floor with her, being present when my big kids get home from school, working while she sleeps\u2026 or honestly, just sitting down for five minutes.\n\nBetween nursing a baby, getting the big kids up and out the door, laundry, dishes, work and everything else that keeps a family running, I realized I don\u2019t need to figure out how to do more.\n\nI need to figure out what I can take off my plate.\n\nSo I\u2019m delegating the cleaning.\n\nI partnered with @gooddaycleaningservicesllc here in Tulsa to take that off my plate and give me something I can\u2019t make more of \u2014 time.\n\nBecause my house will need to be cleaned again next week. My daughter will never be this little again.\n\nAND I\u2019m giving one of my local mamas the chance to take it off her plate too \ud83e\udef6\ud83c\udffc\n\nTo enter to win a house cleaning from @gooddaycleaningservicesllc:\n\nFollow me + @gooddaycleaningservicesllc\nComment \u201cGood Day!\u201d below\nFill out the quick giveaway form linked in my bio\n\nWinner will be chosen within 24 hours!\n\nPartnership with Good Day Cleaning Services.\n.\n.\n.\n[motherhood, mom life, parenthood, life with kids, girl mom, boy mom, real motherhood, for you page, explore page, viral reel, deliberate mama, mom influencer]", "hashtags": [], "mentions": ["gooddaycleaningservicesllc"], "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DcKaOFMOwCh/", "commentsCount": 18, "dimensionsHeight": 1916, "dimensionsWidth": 1080, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fmel15-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/778625767_18109523855517637_3374066549